	<!-- News Post 1 -->
	<item>
		<title>Annual Leadership Summit 2026: Accelerating Sustainable Development Goals</title>
		<link>https://organization.lk/annual-leadership-summit-2026/</link>
		<pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<category domain="category" nicename="event"><![CDATA[Event]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://organization.lk/?p=201</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Over 400 national leaders, institutional directors, and civic innovators gathered in Colombo to ratify the National Sustainable Governance Charter for 2026-2030.</p>
<h3>Historic Gathering at Apex Convention Centre</h3>
<p>The National Foundation for Development &amp; Governance successfully concluded its flagship Annual Leadership Summit today. With representatives from all 9 provinces, regional development chambers, and multilateral partner bodies, the summit focused on key institutional pillars.</p>
<blockquote>"Our strength lies in collective civic determination. True leadership is not about maintaining authority, but about equipping communities to solve their own challenges with dignity and transparency." — Dr. Senaka Wickramasinghe, Chairman of the Board</blockquote>
<p>Delegates unanimously signed the Colombo Accord on Transparent Governance, committing partner bodies to publish annual integrity audits and open-data reports accessible to the general public.</p>]]></content:encoded>
		<wp:post_id>201</wp:post_id>
		<wp:post_date><![CDATA[2026-03-15 08:30:00]]></wp:post_date>
		<wp:post_type><![CDATA[post]]></wp:post_type>
		<wp:status><![CDATA[publish]]></wp:status>
	</item>

