	<item>
		<title>Board of Directors Announces Expansion of Rural Technology Hubs</title>
		<link>https://organization.lk/expansion-of-rural-technology-hubs/</link>
		<pubDate>Mon, 02 Mar 2026 10:15:00 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<category domain="category" nicename="announcement"><![CDATA[Announcement]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://organization.lk/?p=202</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Phase III of the National Digital Empowerment Initiative will install 15 solar-powered learning and technology centers across regional districts.</p>
<p>Following the Board of Directors quarterly review meeting, the Foundation approved a capital allocation of LKR 180 Million dedicated to establishing 15 state-of-the-art Technology and Learning Hubs in underserved regional communities.</p>]]></content:encoded>
